1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:10,899
Today we are going to learn
about steps and skips.

3
00:00:12,899 --> 00:00:16,867
A tune can walk… one step at a time.

4
00:00:17,467 --> 00:00:23,479
Each time, we move to the
next key… That is a step.

5
00:00:26,679 --> 00:00:30,741
Or a tune can jump… and miss one out.

6
00:00:31,341 --> 00:00:33,220
That is a skip.

7
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:42,711
Step… skip… step… skip.

8
00:00:45,911 --> 00:00:48,997
Now let's see them on the stave.

9
00:00:49,597 --> 00:00:53,055
Line to space… is a step.

10
00:00:53,655 --> 00:00:57,345
And space to line… is a step too.

11
00:01:00,545 --> 00:01:06,789
Line to line… misses
one out… That is a skip.

12
00:01:07,389 --> 00:01:11,358
And space to space… is a skip too.

13
00:01:14,558 --> 00:01:19,363
Steps are close together…
skips are further apart.

14
00:01:22,963 --> 00:01:29,114
Listen. Step… step… step… skip!

15
00:01:32,314 --> 00:01:35,076
Your turn! Listen and look.

16
00:01:35,576 --> 00:01:38,894
Is this… a step or a skip?

17
00:01:43,194 --> 00:01:44,655
A step.

18
00:01:46,455 --> 00:01:47,730
And this?

19
00:01:51,830 --> 00:01:53,291
A skip.

20
00:01:55,091 --> 00:01:57,760
Which jump is the skip?

21
00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:03,274
This one.

22
00:02:04,174 --> 00:02:05,496
You've got it!

23
00:02:07,196 --> 00:02:08,657
Now it's your turn!

24
00:02:08,857 --> 00:02:12,733
Play Step or Skip and
hear the difference!

25
00:02:14,533 --> 00:02:18,843
Grown-ups, subscribe so
you never miss a Nugget.

26
00:02:18,893 --> 00:02:22,078
New ones every Wednesday and Saturday.

27
00:02:22,378 --> 00:02:24,767
See you for the next Nugget!

